%% 09-builds.mgp - learn MagicPoint on gucOS, deck 9 of 10 (todos/0202).
%% Progressive reveal (%pause), column layout (%mark/%again), super/
%% subscripts (%sup/%sub/%setsup).
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "MidnightBlue", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%tab 1 size 4, vgap 40, prefix "  ", icon box "SpringGreen" 50, left
%tab 2 size 3, vgap 40, prefix "      ", icon arc "gold" 50, left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Builds and columns

deck 9 of 10: pause, mark, again, sup, sub
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%pause - reveal in steps

	drawing STOPS at each %pause
%pause
	the forward key continues it
%pause
	the back key backs up one step
%pause
%size 4, fore "orange", center

use it to keep eyes on the point being made
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Two columns: mark, again

%size 4, fore "white", left
%mark
%prefix 8
the LEFT column:
mark remembers this
vertical position
%again
%prefix 55
the RIGHT column:
again jumps back up,
prefix moves it over
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Columns, step by step

	put %mark where the columns start
	draw column one, prefix at the left
	%again rewinds to the mark
	draw column two, prefix further right
		marks are per-page; they clear at %page
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Super and subscripts

%size 5, fore "white", left
E = mc
%cont, sup
2
%size 5
H
%cont, sub
2
%cont
O
%size 4, fore "gray70"

each rides a %cont continuation: the sup/sub
line is drawn raised or lowered, and smaller
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Tuning scripts

	%setsup 40 15 60 sets the geometry:
		raise offset, drop offset, scale
	values are percent of the char size
	the default suits formulas - leave it be
%pause
%size 4, center, fore "SpringGreen"

one build idea per page; two is a magic trick
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
next: 10-mastery.mgp
